  "description": "A tall curved teal frame shaped like a giraffe holds a single orange nest seat on the Giraffe Swing. The round nest seat lets a small child sit or lie in it, and it swings in a gentle arc. It is meant for the 3 to 6 years Key User Group and carries one child. The frame takes up 9'7\" x 9'8\" and needs a safe play area of 11'7\" x 15'7\". The giraffe shape makes it a strong theme piece for a nursery, play school or society toddler zone. The colour is Horizon Teal. The warranty runs 3 years on the galvanised frame and roto-moulded seat, and 1 year on bearings. Ask us to place it on your layout drawing.",
